@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = replace-with-login-access-token
@conversationId = 22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### 按最近访问时间倒序查询本人会话；page 从 1 开始，size 范围 1～100
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 查询单个会话元数据和最近成功轮次；不返回摘要正文或 Agent 内部状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 原子重置本人会话；替换为详情接口返回的当前 version
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}/reset
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedVersion": 1
}

### 原子删除本人会话；替换为详情接口返回的当前 version
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}?expectedVersion=0
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
